# Integration Rules

## Data access

- UI components and pages MUST import `repo` from `@/api/repository` (or `@/data/repository` shim).
- NEVER import from `@/api/adapters/mock/*` in pages or components.
- Backend work goes in `src/api/adapters/http/repository.ts` and `src/api/adapters/http/auth.ts`.
- Use `apiClient` from `src/api/adapters/http/client.ts` for HTTP calls.

## Types

- Domain types live in `src/types/`. API responses must match these shapes.
- Transform API payloads in the HTTP adapter if backend shape differs.

## Auth

- Use `authService` from `@/api/auth`.
- Session zones: `client` | `admin`. Enforced by `RequireAuth`.
- Demo credentials in `src/config/demo-users.ts`.

## Routing

- Routes defined in `src/app/router.tsx` and `src/app/routes/*`.
- When merging into another app, import `clientRoutes` and `adminRoutes` — do not duplicate route trees.

## Styling

- Design tokens in `src/styles/globals.css`. Do not hardcode colors outside the token system.
- Use existing `components/ui/*` primitives before creating new ones.

## Environment

- `VITE_USE_MOCK_DATA=true` → mock adapters (default)
- `VITE_USE_MOCK_DATA=false` → HTTP adapters (requires implementation)

## Documentation

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/INTEGRATION.md` before large integration changes.
